@* A group that folds. shadcn wraps the group in a Collapsible and makes the label its trigger;
   here the collapsible IS a <details>, so the fold is the browser own — it works with no script,
   it is in the page for a crawler, and the chevron turns on [open] rather than on a state
   variable.

   The <summary> has to be the FIRST CHILD of the <details>, which is why the collapsible sits
   inside the group rather than around it: wrapped the other way the summary is a grandchild, and
   a grandchild summary opens nothing at all. *@
<SidebarFrame Height="340px">
    <Sidebar Collapsible="icon">
        <SidebarContent>
            <SidebarGroup>
                <Collapsible Open Class="group/collapsible">
                    <CollapsibleTrigger>
                        <SidebarGroupLabel Class="w-full cursor-pointer">
                            Help
                            <Icon Name="chevron-down"
                                  Class="ms-auto transition-transform group-open/collapsible:rotate-180" />
                        </SidebarGroupLabel>
                    </CollapsibleTrigger>
                    <CollapsibleContent>
                        <SidebarGroupContent>
                            <SidebarMenu>
                                <SidebarMenuItem>
                                    <SidebarMenuButton Href="/components/dialog">
                                        <Icon Name="info" /><span>Support</span>
                                    </SidebarMenuButton>
                                </SidebarMenuItem>
                                <SidebarMenuItem>
                                    <SidebarMenuButton Href="/components/table">
                                        <Icon Name="menu" /><span>Documentation</span>
                                    </SidebarMenuButton>
                                </SidebarMenuItem>
                            </SidebarMenu>
                        </SidebarGroupContent>
                    </CollapsibleContent>
                </Collapsible>
            </SidebarGroup>
        </SidebarContent>
    </Sidebar>
    <SidebarInset Class="p-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Fold the group from its own label.</SidebarInset>
</SidebarFrame>
